🎉 PHP 8.6.0 Alpha 3 is available for testing!

This continues the PHP 8.3 release cycle, featuring:

- Implemented partial function application RFC
- New IO copy API for faster stream copying
- Several GMP improvements

… and more!

✅ Test your projects
❌ Not for production

Congrats @mbeccati@phpc.social, @joepferguson@phpc.social, and Daniel Scherzer

